### Localhost - Get all playlists
GET http://localhost:3000/api/playlists

### Localhost - Get playlist by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/playlists/6ad1a1a3a6238671da0fb678

### Localhost - Create playlist
POST http://localhost:3000/api/playlists
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "Folk Essentials",
  "description": "Acoustic stories and timeless melodies — my favorite folk tracks",
  "creator": "Jesus Tortolero",
  "genre": "folk",
  "songs": [
    "Blowin' in the Wind - Bob Dylan",
    "The Sound of Silence - Simon & Garfunkel",
    "Landslide - Fleetwood Mac",
    "Fast Car - Tracy Chapman",
    "Vincent - Don McLean",
    "Hallelujah - Leonard Cohen",
    "The Boxer - Simon & Garfunkel",
    "Wild World - Cat Stevens",
    "Both Sides, Now - Joni Mitchell"
  ],
  "isPublic": true,
  "coverImage": "https://picsum.photos/400/400?random=7"
}

### Localhost - Update playlist
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/playlists/6ad1a330a6238671da0fb680
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Reggae Roots & Vibes"
}

### Localhost - Delete playlist
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/playlists/6ad1a330a6238671da0fb680

